description: Protect templates/index.json from accidental overwrites
globs: templates/index.json
alwaysApply: false
---

# Do NOT edit templates/index.json

This file holds Shopify theme customizer data (uploaded images, spacing, section order).

- **Never modify** `templates/index.json` unless the user explicitly asks.
- Section `.liquid` files and `.css` assets are fine to edit.
- To add sections to homepage, tell the user to add them in Theme Editor — do not write index.json yourself.
- A `.shopifyignore` entry prevents `shopify theme dev` from pushing local index.json to remote.
